# The signed WebDriverAgent build is a code-signed binary tree. Any line-ending
# or encoding conversion would change bytes and INVALIDATE the code signature,
# after which iOS refuses to install it. Force git to treat all of it as opaque
# binary so a clone is byte-for-byte what was committed.
wda/** binary

# ...except the doc that explains it, which should stay diffable. Later rules win.
wda/*.md text diff

# Screenshots — baselines, templates and committed captures. Never touched.
*.png binary
